      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Same here. I have really fast internet and the connection is fine everyone else. But within the last month VRChat often takes extremely long to load anything. Sometimes it helps if i hop back to my home world and try to join a world again 3-5 times. Same with avatar loading. Some load at normal speed and the other 60+% in the room just take forever. If i rejoin that instance often enough, it suddenly loads at normal speed again.... until someone new joins or i hop to a different world again. EU Player here if that matters. I didnt try tho if this only happens in specificly JP, EU or US instances or in all",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
