  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-11-17T04:02:15.133Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Vrchat is taking 10 times longer to load. I've had reports from other people and it happens with me where it took 45 minutes to load into a 6mb world. It keeps you in the green void of nothingness for 30 minutes. Then all my social list said my friends were in \"WORLD NAME\" and it would not let me join. The average time to load anything is 20 minutes. This issue began on Sunday.",
